' Which profile a dictation uses, and where each of its values comes
' from: the structure. The texts come from which-setting-applies.<lang>.puml,
' which includes this file after style.iuml. Facts checked against the
' code; see the comments for where.

start
' app_profiles.rs: begin_dictation chooses a profile when the recording
' starts (its model loads, the pills name it); settle_dictation chooses
' again when it ends, by the application in front then.
:$ends;
note right: $noteStart
' profile_at_end and profile_for_dictation: only while
' profile_auto_by_app is on and some profile has applications
' (has_assignments); an application belongs to at most one profile
' (set_apps). Otherwise active_profile_id: DEFAULT_PROFILE_ID for the
' defaults, or a profile. The sidebar box "In Use" (ProfileSelector.tsx)
' names the defaults with tray.defaultSettings.
if ($qByApp) then ($yes)
  :$appProfile;
else ($no)
  :$inUse;
  ' window_capture::frontmost_app is None on Linux.
  note right: $noteLinux
endif
' profile_layers.rs: a profile holds each value coupled (it equals the
' default) or as its own; the state line under a setting says "Default"
' or "Own value" (ScopedSetting.tsx, StateLine; the broken chain is
' Link2Off). Lists (LIST_FIELDS: end_keys, word_lists, bindings, the
' providers' entries) go entry by entry (merge_list): that is shown in
' defaults-and-profiles, not here.
switch ($qSetting)
case ($aOwn)
  :$own;
case ($aCoupled)
  :$default;
case ($aDefaults)
  :$default;
endswitch
' profile_redo.rs: before the text goes into an application (at the end
' of the dictation, with "Paste Last Transcript" or the service), the
' profile of that application is looked up again (target_for, only while
' choosing by application is on) and the dictation redone from the first
' step that differs (redo_from: transcription, post-processing, Append).
:$runs;
note right: $noteRedo
stop
